meta {
  name: Briefings - Update
  type: http
  seq: 51
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/:workspace/assistant/briefings/:type
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  workspace: {{workspaceId}}
  type: daily
}

body:json {
  {
    "enabled": true,
    "schedule": {
      "time": "08:00",
      "days": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5],
      "timezone": "Europe/London"
    },
    "connector_scope": "selected",
    "connector_keys": ["gmail", "google-calendar"],
    "instructions": "Lead with anything that needs a reply today.",
    "delivery": {
      "email": true
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Saves a background report's settings. Requires the `assistant.use`
  permission. Every field is optional (partial update):

  - `enabled` (bool)
  - `schedule` — `{ time: "H:i", days: [1-7, distinct, min 1], timezone }`;
    all three are required when `schedule` is sent. Legacy zone names are
    accepted.
  - `connector_scope` — `all` | `selected`; `connector_keys` (nullable,
    max 50 strings) applies to `selected`.
  - `instructions` (nullable, max 4000 chars)
  - `delivery.email` (bool)
  - `settings` — Meeting Prep only: `auto` (bool), `minutes_before`
    (5–240), `scope` (`external_only` | `all`).

  Response is wrapped: same shape as `Briefings - Get`.
}
